---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Features" description="Explore the Yevqo Android server platform features.">
  <div class="page-kicker">01 / CAPABILITIES</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">A control plane for<br/><span>your Android server.</span></h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Yevqo brings the tools for running projects on Android into one focused workspace. The product is being built around Termux and the device you already own.</p>
  <div class="page-grid">
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">01 / HOSTING</span><h2>Android hosting</h2><p>Use your Android device as the machine behind personal websites, APIs and small services.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">02 / WORKSPACE</span><h2>Project management</h2><p>Keep applications, environments and project settings organized in one place.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">03 / DELIVERY</span><h2>Deployments</h2><p>A streamlined workflow for preparing and running projects in the Termux environment.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">04 / BUILD</span><h2>Build management</h2><p>Review build output and understand what happened when a project is prepared.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">05 / VISIBILITY</span><h2>Monitoring</h2><p>See device load, memory, storage and the status of your applications.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">06 / SOURCE</span><h2>Git integration</h2><p>Bring repositories into the same workflow as the projects you run.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">07 / STARTER KIT</span><h2>Templates</h2><p>Start from common project structures instead of setting up every folder by hand.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">08 / OBSERVABILITY</span><h2>Logs & events</h2><p>A readable activity history for builds, deployments and services.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">09 / ROADMAP</span><h2>AI agents</h2><p>Specialized agents are planned for future releases and are not available yet.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="page-note"><strong>Product status:</strong> This page describes the intended Yevqo feature set. The website is currently a frontend preview; live device connection and management operations are not implemented yet.</div>
</SiteLayout>
